<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.42 pct at auction SUVL.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.42 pct at auction SUVL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/96 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office  SUVL :  ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     18-04-2006</p>
<p> COUPON:				 7.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.42 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  105.70*</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,500 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 3,260 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES: The previous auction of the bond raised 1.48 billion markka at a price of 102.35 and a yield of 6.90 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 15.52 billion markka.</p>
<p>* 68.55 percent of bids were accepted at the 105.70 price.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
